WEBVTT

01:30.460 --> 01:34.940
[The Heir]

01:35.410 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 13]

01:37.990 --> 01:40.700
-Li Ink Workshop's ink testing event.
-Everyone's gone to Tian Ink.

01:40.700 --> 01:41.560
Come and have a look.

01:41.560 --> 01:42.310
Jinhe.

01:42.310 --> 01:45.229
-Good things take time. Be patient.
-This is outrageous!

01:45.229 --> 01:48.530
Li Ink Workshop's
ancient lacquer-soot ink testing event.

01:48.530 --> 01:49.950
Come and have a look, everyone.

01:49.950 --> 01:51.039
Let's wait a little longer.

01:51.039 --> 01:52.200
Come on in and have a look.

01:52.200 --> 01:55.100
Li Ink Workshop's
ancient lacquer-soot ink testing event.

01:55.100 --> 01:56.060
-You were saying...
-Mother.

01:56.060 --> 01:57.650
Jinhe, Rujun.

01:59.259 --> 02:00.540
Congratulations.

02:00.570 --> 02:01.820
Thank you.

02:02.480 --> 02:05.870
That day, Lord Yan set a challenge
for all the ink makers.

02:06.070 --> 02:07.330
Who would have thought

02:07.590 --> 02:09.870
that Zhen would beat us all to the punch

02:09.870 --> 02:13.150
and be the first to recreate
this ancient lacquer-soot ink?

02:13.150 --> 02:14.430
Congratulations.

02:18.430 --> 02:20.360
But where is Zhen now?

02:20.800 --> 02:24.120
Zhen went to the street corner
to welcome Lord Yan.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.630
Since she solved his challenge,

02:26.630 --> 02:30.630
it's only right that she personally
presents him with the final result.

02:43.190 --> 02:45.630
I, Li Zhen, humbly welcome Lord Yan.

02:45.870 --> 02:47.400
Lower the sedan chair.

02:51.520 --> 02:52.520
Zhen?

02:54.120 --> 02:56.500
We are still some distance away
from Sibao Street.

02:56.500 --> 02:58.570
Why are you stopping my sedan here?

02:58.630 --> 03:01.150
I want to ease your concerns, Lord Yan.

03:01.150 --> 03:02.950
That is why I waited for you here.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.000
Ease my concerns?

03:08.750 --> 03:11.680
Alright, then tell me.

03:11.910 --> 03:13.190
What concerns do I have?

03:13.190 --> 03:14.080
Lord Yan,

03:14.310 --> 03:17.260
with invitations from
both the Li family and the Tian family,

03:17.260 --> 03:18.960
you came to Sibao Street today.

03:18.960 --> 03:21.000
I'm afraid you're troubled
over

03:21.079 --> 03:23.940
which house to visit first
and which to visit later.

03:24.710 --> 03:26.910
Logically speaking,
this ancient lacquer-soot ink

03:26.910 --> 03:29.750
was a challenge personally issued by you.

03:29.910 --> 03:32.560
And I was lucky enough to make the ink,

03:32.750 --> 03:35.190
so you should visit Li Ink first.

03:35.840 --> 03:38.800
But the Tian family has great influence,

03:39.280 --> 03:40.910
and is on close terms
with the county magistrate.

03:40.910 --> 03:43.110
You can't afford to offend them as well.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.190
My Lord, you delayed

03:44.190 --> 03:46.290
your departure by the time
it takes to burn one incense stick.

03:46.290 --> 03:48.770
I assume this was weighing on your mind.

03:49.240 --> 03:50.710
Then tell me.

03:51.430 --> 03:53.280
What brilliant solution do you have?

03:53.280 --> 03:54.120
Lord Yan,

03:54.280 --> 03:56.240
you simply need to take a different route.

03:56.240 --> 03:57.280
A different route?

03:57.280 --> 03:59.670
My Lord, if you continue straight ahead,

03:59.800 --> 04:02.120
you'll enter Sibao Street
through the south gate.

04:02.120 --> 04:04.630
Within a few steps, you will find
the Tian Ink Workshop.

04:04.630 --> 04:07.280
It would be impossible to
pass their doors without entering.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.680
But if you

04:09.590 --> 04:10.850
make a turn right here,

04:10.910 --> 04:13.710
you'll enter Sibao Street
through the north gate.

04:13.710 --> 04:16.800
Li Ink Workshop is the closest
to the north gate.

04:16.870 --> 04:18.720
That way, it would be perfectly reasonable

04:18.720 --> 04:20.430
for you to visit Li Ink Workshop first.

04:20.430 --> 04:21.160
Lead the way.

04:21.430 --> 04:21.800
Yes, My Lord!

04:21.800 --> 04:23.750
Raise the sedan chair.

04:25.720 --> 04:26.510
This way.

04:35.430 --> 04:36.480
Please come in.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.080
Benchang!

04:38.040 --> 04:38.640
Benchang!

04:40.000 --> 04:40.480
Benchang!

04:40.480 --> 04:41.000
What's the rush?

04:41.000 --> 04:42.680
Li Zhen is leading Lord Yan's sedan chair.

04:42.680 --> 04:43.950
They just made a turn up ahead!

04:43.950 --> 04:45.550
We've been played by Li Zhen.

04:46.240 --> 04:46.950
Follow me.

04:54.630 --> 04:55.490
Tian Benchang.

04:55.800 --> 04:57.040
What are you doing here?

04:57.040 --> 04:57.920
Step aside.

04:59.040 --> 05:00.120
I, Tian Benchang,

05:00.120 --> 05:02.430
humbly welcome Lord Yan to Tian Ink.

05:08.270 --> 05:11.070
Young Master Tian,
coming all this way to greet me—

05:12.830 --> 05:14.360
thank you for your trouble.

05:14.630 --> 05:15.720
Today, Tian Ink

05:15.750 --> 05:17.750
is holding an ink testing event
for the Baibao Ink.

05:17.750 --> 05:19.650
County Magistrate, Lord Zhao,
is also invited

05:19.650 --> 05:21.530
and is waiting to speak with you.

05:21.800 --> 05:24.360
That is why he specifically sent me here

05:24.390 --> 05:25.720
to welcome you, my Lord.

05:25.800 --> 05:26.950
Young Master Tian,

05:27.140 --> 05:28.450
today the Li Ink

05:28.480 --> 05:30.510
is also holding an ink testing event
for the lacquer-soot ink.

05:30.510 --> 05:31.680
And this lacquer-soot ink

05:31.680 --> 05:35.340
was a challenge Lord Yan himself
set for the Huizhou ink industry.

05:35.440 --> 05:36.720
Now that the ink has been recreated,

05:36.720 --> 05:38.920
Lord Yan should
naturally visit Li Ink first

05:38.920 --> 05:40.750
to inspect and verify the results.

05:40.750 --> 05:42.390
Young Master Tian, calm down.

05:42.390 --> 05:44.120
You only need to wait two more hours.

05:44.120 --> 05:44.870
Li Zhen.

05:46.680 --> 05:49.600
Lord Yan is the court appointed
Ink Affairs Official.

05:49.600 --> 05:51.190
He is also a local magistrate.

05:51.190 --> 05:53.590
He should treat every ink workshop fairly.

05:53.800 --> 05:56.510
You intercepted his sedan chair halfway—

05:56.570 --> 05:57.810
are you trying to give Lord Yan

05:57.810 --> 05:59.630
a bad reputation for favoritism?

05:59.630 --> 06:00.490
Tian Benchang,

06:00.600 --> 06:01.680
what nonsense are you talking about?

06:01.680 --> 06:03.680
The County Magistrate has arrived.

06:15.630 --> 06:17.360
Greetings, Lord Yan.

06:17.480 --> 06:18.560
Lord Zhao.

06:18.680 --> 06:20.870
I've been occupied
with official duties recently

06:20.870 --> 06:22.040
and haven't had the chance to visit you.

06:22.040 --> 06:24.040
I hope you don't mind.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.430
You are too courteous.

06:25.560 --> 06:27.600
You are the local official of Shexian,

06:27.600 --> 06:29.560
I should have visited you long ago.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.600
What a coincidence.

06:33.600 --> 06:36.560
The Tian family is holding
an ink testing event today.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.560
Lord Yan, why not accompany me

06:38.560 --> 06:39.630
and have a look?

06:39.720 --> 06:40.580
What do you say?

06:42.510 --> 06:43.240
After you.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.420
Very well. Please.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.750
Please follow me.

07:02.390 --> 07:03.160
Zhen.

07:04.360 --> 07:05.800
I know you were the one

07:06.040 --> 07:07.900
who solved Lord Yan's challenge.

07:07.950 --> 07:09.610
But that alone won't be enough

07:10.390 --> 07:12.050
to steal the spotlight today.

07:12.430 --> 07:13.560
In the ink industry,

07:13.600 --> 07:14.800
you can't make a name for yourself

07:14.800 --> 07:16.750
based solely on a few fine sticks of ink.

07:16.750 --> 07:18.310
After all, you're only a woman.

07:18.310 --> 07:19.970
Don't push yourself too hard.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.630
Likewise, likewise.

07:21.870 --> 07:24.670
Today, the Tian family is
offering a 30% discount.

07:24.800 --> 07:26.560
Isn't that because you were
afraid the ink merchants

07:26.560 --> 07:29.240
would be drawn away
by Li Ink's ancient lacquer-soot ink?

07:29.240 --> 07:31.070
So you're selling at a loss now?

07:31.630 --> 07:32.720
Everything I said

07:32.750 --> 07:33.950
was for your own good.

07:35.190 --> 07:36.750
Thank you, Young Master Tian.

07:36.750 --> 07:37.720
I don't need it.

07:43.420 --> 07:46.620
Lord Yan and Lord Zhao have arrived!

07:49.020 --> 07:53.080
[Yaji Hall]

07:55.920 --> 07:57.310
Lower the sedan chair.

08:03.830 --> 08:04.480
Lord Yan.

08:04.680 --> 08:06.480
Please.

08:07.800 --> 08:08.560
Lord Zhao.

08:08.630 --> 08:09.600
This way.

08:09.720 --> 08:10.250
Lord Yan.

08:10.320 --> 08:15.880
[Sihe Ink]

08:12.510 --> 08:14.070
Just as I expected,

08:14.770 --> 08:18.370
another petty opportunist
who only protects his own interests.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.480
Don't talk nonsense.

08:24.160 --> 08:25.310
Lord Zhao

08:25.600 --> 08:27.720
is a local governing official after all.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.480
Lord Yan came from the capital,

08:29.600 --> 08:31.870
so Lord Zhao must show him some courtesy.

08:32.750 --> 08:33.510
Mother.

08:34.679 --> 08:36.679
The auspicious hour is almost here.

08:36.750 --> 08:38.080
With the Ink Affairs Official absent,

08:38.080 --> 08:41.080
who exactly are we
holding this ink testing event for?

08:42.059 --> 08:42.530
Be patient.

08:42.530 --> 08:45.360
Fine wine fears no dark alley.

08:46.000 --> 08:48.150
As long as Li Ink produces fine ink,

08:48.440 --> 08:50.970
why should we fear
that customers won't come?

08:51.000 --> 08:52.030
Calm down.

08:52.550 --> 08:53.670
Prepare the brushes and paper.

08:53.670 --> 08:55.200
Once Mr. Dongtu arrives,

08:55.200 --> 08:57.010
we shall begin the ink testing at once.

08:57.010 --> 08:58.080
Sixth Grandfather.

08:58.080 --> 09:00.510
People have to smell fine wine first.

09:00.730 --> 09:02.550
If we don't make a good first impression,

09:02.550 --> 09:04.360
it'll be difficult
to break into the market later.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.960
Everyone understands that.

09:06.560 --> 09:09.290
The point is that
customers have to show up first.

09:09.720 --> 09:10.670
Since no one is here right now,

09:10.670 --> 09:11.930
what can we do about it?

09:16.840 --> 09:17.480
Doggie.

09:17.910 --> 09:19.440
Come over and give us a hand.

09:37.390 --> 09:40.870
This Baibao Ink is as resilient
as iron and stone,

09:41.240 --> 09:42.700
as lustrous as black jade,

09:42.910 --> 09:44.440
and as fragrant as orchids.

09:45.270 --> 09:48.510
It truly is a rare, fine-grade ink.

09:48.730 --> 09:49.570
Very good.

09:49.720 --> 09:51.440
You flatter me.

09:56.670 --> 10:00.240
What's the point of drawing a crowd
if they're only here to watch?

10:00.240 --> 10:01.600
All this shouting,

10:02.150 --> 10:04.000
can it bring Lord Yan here?

10:04.670 --> 10:06.600
I just want to draw Lord Yan

10:06.630 --> 10:08.440
right into Li Ink Workshop.

10:09.390 --> 10:12.910
Master Qi and Mr. Dongtu have arrived.

10:15.790 --> 10:16.870
Mr. Dongtu.

10:17.960 --> 10:18.870
Master Qi.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.420
Seventh Old Madam.

10:21.600 --> 10:23.120
Mount Qiyun is far away.

10:23.270 --> 10:25.400
Please forgive me for my late arrival.

10:26.720 --> 10:28.790
Thank you for coming, Mr. Dongtu,

10:28.790 --> 10:30.030
to test the ink for Li Ink.

10:30.030 --> 10:32.360
You are too courteous, Seventh Old Madam.

10:32.550 --> 10:34.030
Mr. Dongtu, please.

10:34.720 --> 10:35.720
This way, please.

10:38.120 --> 10:39.850
An open-air ink testing event?

10:40.120 --> 10:42.380
This is the first time I've ever seen one.

10:43.510 --> 10:45.200
Our young friend Li Zhen

10:45.270 --> 10:48.270
always does things in unexpected ways.

10:49.000 --> 10:50.600
But it's quite interesting.

10:51.550 --> 10:53.010
Very interesting indeed.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.850
Mr. Dongtu, you flatter me.

10:54.890 --> 10:56.740
Today, I must rely on

10:56.770 --> 10:58.030
your splendid skills.

10:58.550 --> 11:00.390
Miss Li Zhen, a word in private.

11:03.510 --> 11:06.030
The Tian family is truly despicable.

11:06.200 --> 11:08.600
I heard they intercepted Lord Yan halfway.

11:09.550 --> 11:12.000
The favorable wind you were counting on
has now shifted to their side.

11:12.000 --> 11:13.330
What are you going to do?

11:15.510 --> 11:17.040
Since we can't be the first,

11:17.150 --> 11:18.550
then we'll be one of a kind.

11:18.550 --> 11:19.390
Master Qi,

11:19.480 --> 11:21.550
you have wide connections in Huizhou.

11:21.550 --> 11:24.320
Could you bring more people over
to build up momentum?

11:24.320 --> 11:25.200
No problem.

11:25.390 --> 11:25.960
Go ahead.

11:31.240 --> 11:33.840
I wonder if Master Qi's plan will work.

11:34.320 --> 11:35.250
Let's go and see.

11:42.270 --> 11:45.120
Mr. Dongtu is painting
at Li Ink Workshop right now.

11:45.120 --> 11:46.550
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!

11:46.550 --> 11:47.270
Indeed.

11:47.320 --> 11:48.670
I heard that Mr. Dongtu

11:48.670 --> 11:50.940
deliberately left
a blank space for an inscription.

11:50.940 --> 11:53.320
Now he is quietly waiting
for someone worthy to inscribe it.

11:53.320 --> 11:55.270
If we seize the right moment

11:55.360 --> 11:58.470
and manage to write a poem
on Mr. Dongtu's painting,

11:58.670 --> 12:01.080
our names will be remembered for ages!

12:01.870 --> 12:03.630
Then let's not waste any time. Let's go.

12:03.630 --> 12:04.000
Please.

12:04.000 --> 12:04.630
Very well.

12:06.320 --> 12:07.120
Lord Yan.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.530
Lord Zhao, what fine calligraphy.

12:11.310 --> 12:13.310
Something suddenly occurred to me.

12:13.510 --> 12:18.000
Today, the Li family
is also holding an ink testing event

12:19.120 --> 12:21.200
for their ancient lacquer-soot ink.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.790
As the Ink Affairs Official,

12:22.790 --> 12:25.360
I should be there to witness it.

12:25.750 --> 12:30.270
It happens that Mr. Dongtu
is painting there,

12:30.360 --> 12:34.200
and waiting for someone to inscribe it.

12:34.630 --> 12:36.320
Come to think of it,

12:36.630 --> 12:40.200
you know how valuable
Mr. Dongtu's paintings are—

12:40.440 --> 12:42.840
even the Imperial Palace collects them!

12:43.440 --> 12:45.320
If we seize this opportunity

12:45.360 --> 12:46.270
you and I

12:46.270 --> 12:48.670
inscribe Mr. Dongtu's painting together,

12:49.030 --> 12:52.030
then once this painting
becomes famous in the future,

12:52.440 --> 12:56.240
wouldn't that make a great story for us?

13:00.440 --> 13:01.440
Alright.

13:01.440 --> 13:03.480
Time waits for no one.
Opportunities like this are rare.

13:03.480 --> 13:04.870
Let's go right now.

13:04.870 --> 13:05.400
Lord Yan.

13:05.910 --> 13:06.390
Lord Yan,

13:06.390 --> 13:07.240
My Lords, please stay.

13:07.240 --> 13:08.440
Lord Zhao, Lord Yan.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.870
It won't be too late
to leave after a cup of tea!

13:09.870 --> 13:11.600
The Li family has plenty of fine tea.

13:11.600 --> 13:13.260
Please stay, Your Lordships!

13:15.050 --> 13:19.580
[Sihe Ink]

13:15.840 --> 13:19.080
Is this the
Xin'an River Landscape painting?

13:19.960 --> 13:21.480
You have a sharp eye, sir.

13:21.790 --> 13:23.440
This is the
Xin'an River Landscape painting

13:23.440 --> 13:25.440
that Mr. Dongtu
just painted for the Li family,

13:25.440 --> 13:28.720
using ancient lacquer-soot ink.

13:29.270 --> 13:31.330
Everyone, you may take a closer look.

13:33.080 --> 13:35.810
After all, she's still young
and inexperienced.

13:36.730 --> 13:39.330
She thought things
were simpler than they are.

13:40.020 --> 13:42.220
As if the Lords'd appear out of nowhere.

13:43.550 --> 13:48.000
-Painted with Li Ink's ancient lacquer-soot ink.
-Lord Yan and Lord Zhao have arrived.

13:48.000 --> 13:48.840
Make way.

13:49.440 --> 13:50.360
Make way.

13:52.670 --> 13:54.670
I, Li Zhen, humbly welcome Lord Yan

13:55.390 --> 13:56.360
and Lord Zhao.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.630
Seventh Grandmother!

13:59.030 --> 14:02.600
Lord Yan and Lord Zhao have
graced Li Ink with their presence.

14:02.630 --> 14:05.160
Seventh Old Madam,
sorry to keep you waiting.

14:05.790 --> 14:08.310
It is a great honor for Li Ink

14:08.340 --> 14:10.270
to receive Lord Yan and Lord Zhao today.

14:10.270 --> 14:12.070
Your Lordships, please come in.

14:13.080 --> 14:14.680
Greetings, Your Lordships.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.550
Mr. Dongtu,

14:17.200 --> 14:18.550
I've heard so much about you.

14:18.550 --> 14:20.670
It's an honor to meet you today.

14:20.750 --> 14:21.870
Your Lordships,

14:22.150 --> 14:25.000
Mr. Dongtu has just tested the ink
for the Li family

14:25.000 --> 14:27.860
and created
this Xin'an River Landscape painting.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.750
We had yet to find someone to inscribe it,

14:29.750 --> 14:31.320
and you two have arrived just in time.

14:31.320 --> 14:33.150
It truly feels heaven-sent.

14:33.320 --> 14:35.600
I wonder if you two would be willing

14:35.840 --> 14:38.360
to inscribe the painting?

14:38.630 --> 14:40.390
What do you think, Mr. Dongtu?

14:41.390 --> 14:43.320
If you two were to inscribe it,

14:43.320 --> 14:44.910
it would truly be my honor.

14:46.270 --> 14:48.870
Seventh Grandmother,
I kept my word, didn't I?

14:53.440 --> 14:54.750
Excellent ink.

15:06.910 --> 15:09.810
[Zhao Shen]

15:08.550 --> 15:10.150
Wish you a promising future.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.790
Lord Zhao, fine calligraphy.

15:12.790 --> 15:13.870
You flatter me.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.910
Please bear with my humble attempt.

15:24.760 --> 15:28.240
The Clear Stream clears my heart;
Its water flows apart.

15:28.270 --> 15:30.730
Wonderful calligraphy. Wonderful poetry.

15:35.600 --> 15:37.910
This Xin'an River Landscape painting

15:39.320 --> 15:41.150
perfectly captures Mr. Dongtu's

15:41.150 --> 15:43.240
transcendent and ethereal spirit.

15:44.150 --> 15:45.550
Lord Yan, you flatter me.

15:47.440 --> 15:50.570
The scenery of the Xin'an River
shifts three times a day.

15:50.910 --> 15:54.270
For years, I could never grasp its secret.

15:54.840 --> 15:57.840
Only through this ancient lacquer-soot ink
did I finally understand.

15:57.840 --> 15:59.270
The addition of raw lacquer

15:59.270 --> 16:01.720
gives the ink a deep, shimmering richness.

16:01.750 --> 16:03.870
Combined with varying depths of ink color,

16:03.870 --> 16:06.440
it creates this sense of flowing movement.

16:06.960 --> 16:09.020
It was this ancient lacquer-soot ink

16:09.360 --> 16:12.620
that made this
Xin'an River Landscape painting possible.

16:13.200 --> 16:14.000
Lord Yan,

16:18.470 --> 16:19.430
this Li Ink truly

16:19.860 --> 16:23.430
has truly earned its name
as the finest Hui Ink.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.400
A remarkable ink indeed.

16:29.080 --> 16:29.840
Lord Yan,

16:30.600 --> 16:33.000
now that the ancient lacquer-soot ink
has finally been restored,

16:33.000 --> 16:35.440
I, Qi, wish to take this opportunity

16:35.600 --> 16:37.910
to fulfill the promise I once made.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.000
Xiao Qi.

16:46.910 --> 16:48.910
Here is the reward of one hundred taels.

16:48.910 --> 16:51.080
Yihousheng will award the full amount

16:51.120 --> 16:54.720
to the first person who recreated
the ancient lacquer-soot ink—

16:56.870 --> 16:57.720
Li Zhen.

16:57.750 --> 16:59.910
Bravo!

17:03.200 --> 17:04.160
Just give it to me.

17:04.160 --> 17:04.750
It's heavy.

17:04.750 --> 17:06.349
It's alright. I can carry it.

17:07.400 --> 17:08.460
Put the lid back on.

17:08.480 --> 17:09.640
Leave it open.

17:12.109 --> 17:15.349
Bravo!

17:25.510 --> 17:28.480
Bravo!

17:42.200 --> 17:43.750
These are different patterns.

17:43.750 --> 17:45.720
Do you know who designed them?

17:45.790 --> 17:46.310
Who?

17:46.310 --> 17:47.200
My third aunt.

17:47.200 --> 17:48.800
She is incredibly talented.

17:50.070 --> 17:51.070
But, Miss Li Zhen,

17:51.400 --> 17:54.000
That pretentious yet effective move
you pulled today

17:54.000 --> 17:55.510
was truly impressive.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.050
I was genuinely amazed.

17:57.790 --> 17:59.200
If Master Qi hadn't gone early

17:59.200 --> 18:01.790
to Mount Qiyun to invite Mr. Dongtu over,

18:01.960 --> 18:03.890
then no matter how many plans I had,

18:04.000 --> 18:05.440
they would all have been useless.

18:05.440 --> 18:06.790
At today's ink testing event,

18:06.790 --> 18:09.070
Master Qi has made a huge contribution.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.750
But speaking of contributions,

18:11.750 --> 18:14.030
there may have been more than one today.

18:17.270 --> 18:20.270
Lord Fan Sihai has arrived.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.720
Fan Sihai?

18:23.680 --> 18:24.750
Lord Fan.

18:24.920 --> 18:27.650
Forgive us for not
coming out to greet you sooner.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.830
You must be
the Seventh Old Madam of Li Ink.

18:28.820 --> 18:31.720
[Fan Sihai]

18:31.000 --> 18:32.600
I've heard so much about you.

18:33.340 --> 18:35.920
I heard Li Ink has recreated
ancient lacquer-soot ink,

18:35.920 --> 18:37.960
so I came to broaden my horizons.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.420
I prepared a small gift

18:41.790 --> 18:43.240
to congratulate Li Ink.

18:43.400 --> 18:45.200
I brought this specifically
from Dong'e County—

18:45.200 --> 18:46.070
authentic ejiao.

18:46.070 --> 18:47.240
It's a fine tonic.

18:47.680 --> 18:50.270
It can nourish one's blood
and restore vitality.

18:50.270 --> 18:52.480
I wish the Seventh Old Madam good health

18:52.880 --> 18:54.680
and wish Li Ink thriving prosperity.

18:54.680 --> 18:56.400
A prominent merchant of true standing.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.030
One of the most influential merchants.

18:58.030 --> 19:00.920
Just like his name suggests,
he trades goods across the world (Sihai).

19:00.920 --> 19:02.680
Wherever he places an order,

19:03.110 --> 19:05.240
many others follow.

19:05.240 --> 19:07.510
You won't have to worry
about selling these inks anymore.

19:07.510 --> 19:09.200
Master Qi really kept his promise

19:09.200 --> 19:11.030
and brought me a major ink merchant.

19:11.030 --> 19:11.750
Let's go.

19:14.750 --> 19:15.920
She ran fast enough.

19:16.440 --> 19:19.000
Boiling ejiao is just like making ink.

19:19.160 --> 19:21.310
One must endure all kinds of hardships

19:21.310 --> 19:23.750
to achieve a fragrance that lasts forever.

19:24.270 --> 19:25.070
Mr. Fan.

19:26.000 --> 19:26.680
Mr. Fan.

19:27.310 --> 19:29.590
It's been a while. Hope you've been well.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.960
Save it.

19:31.200 --> 19:33.720
Mr. Fan, please take a look at

19:33.720 --> 19:35.510
the Xin'an River Landscape painting.

19:35.510 --> 19:38.160
It's painted by Mr. Dongtu himself,

19:38.720 --> 19:40.780
using the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

19:40.880 --> 19:43.070
recreated by Miss Li Zhen here.

19:43.750 --> 19:44.550
Miss Li Zhen.

19:47.270 --> 19:49.830
The Xin'an River Landscape painting
is truly a masterpiece.

19:49.830 --> 19:53.160
It is truly vivid and majestic.

19:55.960 --> 19:57.620
The ancient lacquer-soot ink

19:58.200 --> 19:59.920
is indeed extraordinary.

20:00.880 --> 20:02.110
Such fine ink,

20:02.200 --> 20:03.920
my merchant ships

20:04.160 --> 20:05.720
should carry no fewer than ten chests.

20:05.720 --> 20:08.920
Thank you for placing this order, Mr. Fan.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.360
The pleasure is mine.

20:11.640 --> 20:13.160
Master Fan ordered

20:13.200 --> 20:16.590
ten chests of
Li Ink's ancient lacquer-soot ink!

20:21.640 --> 20:22.590
Master Qi,

20:23.110 --> 20:25.350
you actually brought Fan Sihai here.

20:26.550 --> 20:28.150
You have my sincere respect.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.730
You flatter me, Old Madam.

20:29.750 --> 20:31.030
I was just lucky enough

20:31.030 --> 20:33.030
to have done a few deals with Mr. Fan,

20:33.110 --> 20:34.790
and earn a bit of his favor.

20:35.270 --> 20:36.590
As far as I know,

20:37.270 --> 20:40.920
Master Fan has never done ink business.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.480
Yet just now, he placed an order

20:42.480 --> 20:44.750
for ten chests without hesitation.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.160
This

20:46.790 --> 20:49.240
must be your doing, Master Qi.

20:50.110 --> 20:51.270
On behalf of Li Ink,

20:51.920 --> 20:53.590
I thank you, Master Qi.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.880
You are very perceptive, Old Madam.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.920
I am also a businessman.

21:02.030 --> 21:04.490
Earlier, I discussed cooperation with you,

21:04.750 --> 21:06.830
at the time you did not know me well,

21:07.000 --> 21:08.110
so you declined,

21:08.240 --> 21:09.350
and I completely understand that.

21:09.350 --> 21:12.110
So today I asked Fan to place that order.

21:12.160 --> 21:13.000
First,

21:13.550 --> 21:17.030
to congratulate the great success
of the Li Ink's ancient lacquer-soot ink,

21:17.030 --> 21:19.030
and to celebrate together with you.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.400
Second,

21:20.790 --> 21:22.250
to stake my own reputation

21:22.310 --> 21:24.440
on Li Ink's future

21:24.590 --> 21:25.790
business prospects.

21:26.720 --> 21:27.480
And finally,

21:27.640 --> 21:30.480
as a sincere gesture of my hope

21:30.510 --> 21:32.170
for a partnership with Li Ink.

21:32.470 --> 21:33.640
As for the partnership,

21:33.640 --> 21:36.400
I hope you will agree to it.

21:37.790 --> 21:39.790
Thank you for your hard work, Master Qi.

21:39.790 --> 21:40.590
Have some tea.

21:50.880 --> 21:52.030
Old Madam, do you

21:53.070 --> 21:54.470
still have any concerns?

21:55.440 --> 21:57.790
They say a decent businessman

21:57.920 --> 22:00.160
prioritizes giving
over competing for profit,

22:00.160 --> 22:02.830
and eliminates harm
before calculating gains.

22:04.580 --> 22:07.510
Master Qi, you truly understand
the way of business.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.750
What exactly does this mean?

22:12.480 --> 22:13.680
A decent businessman

22:14.200 --> 22:16.260
treats righteousness as his profit.

22:17.110 --> 22:19.590
Cooperation should first benefit others,

22:19.680 --> 22:21.920
eliminate any risk to them,

22:22.000 --> 22:25.000
then consider one's own gains and losses.

22:28.790 --> 22:30.200
Well said.

22:32.270 --> 22:33.350
But for Li Ink's

22:34.270 --> 22:35.510
century-old legacy,

22:36.110 --> 22:40.170
we have never partnered or shared equity
with anyone outside the family.

22:40.960 --> 22:44.550
It's only natural for us
to think carefully about it.

22:45.790 --> 22:48.070
Your concerns are thoughtful, Old Madam.

22:48.070 --> 22:49.680
But please rest assured.

22:50.160 --> 22:53.000
I always know my boundaries.

23:00.160 --> 23:02.220
Please take a look at this, Old Madam.

23:02.440 --> 23:04.750
For Yihousheng's partnership with Li Ink,

23:04.750 --> 23:06.640
we only share the profits, not the power.

23:06.640 --> 23:09.570
We will never interfere
in any of Li Ink's decisions.

23:10.750 --> 23:11.810
One thousand taels

23:12.000 --> 23:14.160
invested into Li Ink's
ancient lacquer-soot ink for three years,

23:14.160 --> 23:17.110
and Yihousheng will only
take 30% of the profits.

23:17.720 --> 23:19.380
Here is the contract as proof.

23:19.960 --> 23:22.240
What do you think, Old Madam?

23:33.830 --> 23:36.440
Master Qi, you are so sincere.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.960
I

23:39.160 --> 23:42.110
have no reason left to refuse.

23:43.680 --> 23:45.790
Today, I'll use tea in place of wine

23:45.830 --> 23:47.000
to toast

23:47.480 --> 23:48.960
our partnership.

23:49.030 --> 23:49.640
Cheers.

23:50.350 --> 23:51.550
Thank you, Old Madam.

23:57.010 --> 23:59.840
[Yihousheng]

24:10.110 --> 24:11.200
I must say, Master.

24:12.030 --> 24:14.960
Didn't Seventh Old Madam
agree to cooperate with us?

24:15.200 --> 24:16.440
Why do you still look

24:16.440 --> 24:17.790
unhappy?

24:21.310 --> 24:23.310
Did you not see what happened today?

24:23.440 --> 24:24.720
That Zhao Shen

24:25.200 --> 24:27.510
has always been backing the Tian family.

24:30.400 --> 24:31.790
The Tian family swallowed up

24:31.790 --> 24:33.790
everything the Luo family once had.

24:35.440 --> 24:36.770
It seems over the years,

24:38.070 --> 24:41.070
they've been handsomely
rewarding this Zhao fellow.

24:42.920 --> 24:45.200
If I want to crush the Tian family today,

24:45.920 --> 24:48.750
I must first remove their protector.

24:54.960 --> 24:55.590
Xiao Qi.

24:56.640 --> 24:57.400
Tomorrow,

24:57.640 --> 24:59.270
send someone to keep

24:59.270 --> 25:00.800
a close eye on this Zhao guy.

25:01.030 --> 25:03.030
He has been taking bribes for years.

25:03.400 --> 25:05.330
There must be evidence somewhere.

25:06.070 --> 25:07.880
Perhaps I can use him

25:08.110 --> 25:10.240
to uproot the Tian family completely.

25:19.160 --> 25:20.890
Mother, we're heading to work.

25:20.920 --> 25:21.590
Go ahead.

25:25.750 --> 25:26.550
Mother, we're leaving.

25:26.550 --> 25:27.440
Take care.

25:27.440 --> 25:28.110
Sure.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.270
Father.

25:49.880 --> 25:52.340
You've only been an ink master
for a few days.

25:52.510 --> 25:54.200
You haven't even found your footing yet,

25:54.200 --> 25:56.070
how can you think about slacking off?

25:56.070 --> 25:59.350
Father, she's been busy preparing
for the ink testing event lately.

25:59.350 --> 26:01.150
It's rare for her to get a day off.

26:01.240 --> 26:03.170
Just let her sleep a little longer.

26:30.920 --> 26:32.640
Grandfather, your cough is back again.

26:32.640 --> 26:33.680
I'll go make some pear soup for you.

26:33.680 --> 26:34.540
Just wait here.

26:34.590 --> 26:36.350
I'm perfectly fine.

26:36.480 --> 26:38.640
You should sleep a little longer.

26:38.640 --> 26:38.880
There's no rush.

26:38.880 --> 26:40.030
It'll be ready soon.

26:40.270 --> 26:42.960
Father, that's not what you said just now.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.110
Your grandfather

26:47.110 --> 26:49.040
has a sharp tongue but a soft heart.

26:49.390 --> 26:51.310
Quick, take the tea to him.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.000
Hurry up.

27:01.070 --> 27:03.070
Grandfather, have some tea first.

27:03.070 --> 27:04.870
The pear soup will be ready soon.

27:06.880 --> 27:08.940
Since you're not going to work today,

27:09.790 --> 27:11.880
I'll take this opportunity to teach you

27:11.880 --> 27:13.000
how to mix glue.

27:13.350 --> 27:14.810
Sure thing, Grandfather!

27:15.160 --> 27:16.290
That's wonderful, Grandfather.

27:16.290 --> 27:17.110
I want to hear it.

27:17.110 --> 27:18.040
Please go ahead.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.110
Zhen,

27:24.200 --> 27:26.330
it's not that I'm being unreasonable—

27:28.790 --> 27:31.200
as an ink master in the ink workshop,

27:31.750 --> 27:35.160
you must take responsibility for every
piece of ancient lacquer-soot ink.

27:35.160 --> 27:37.420
You can't slack off for even a single day.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.640
I understand.

27:38.720 --> 27:40.320
I wouldn't dare be careless.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.640
These past few days,

27:43.070 --> 27:46.350
you've been at the workshop learning
glue-mixing from Master Sun.

27:46.350 --> 27:47.610
What have you learned?

27:48.200 --> 27:49.480
Master Sun taught me

27:49.790 --> 27:52.110
that the key of ink lies in the glue.

27:52.350 --> 27:53.310
If the glue is prepared well,

27:53.310 --> 27:55.720
even inferior lampblack
can become fine ink.

27:55.720 --> 27:56.790
But if the glue goes wrong,

27:56.790 --> 27:58.990
the best lampblack will produce waste.

27:59.240 --> 28:00.750
That's exactly right.

28:03.200 --> 28:06.030
Back when Luo Ink was renowned
throughout the world,

28:06.030 --> 28:07.440
its true distinction lays in

28:07.440 --> 28:09.700
its exceptional method of glue-mixing.

28:09.750 --> 28:11.240
It even pioneered its own unique method,

28:11.240 --> 28:14.790
mixing musk powder, jade powder,

28:14.880 --> 28:16.310
gold, and pearl powder

28:16.680 --> 28:18.030
into the glue.

28:18.750 --> 28:21.110
The ink produced is unbreakable

28:21.310 --> 28:24.000
and will never fade on silk paper.

28:24.920 --> 28:29.380
As the saying goes, "Hard as a stone for
10 years, black as lacquer in every drop."

28:29.400 --> 28:31.550
When I was a child, I heard Father say

28:31.680 --> 28:34.110
that Luo Ink was known
for its luxurious richness,

28:34.110 --> 28:36.830
while Li Ink used gamboge,
egg white,

28:36.920 --> 28:39.270
soapberry, rhinoceros horn, and vervain

28:39.480 --> 28:41.720
to create an ink that was
moist and substantial,

28:41.720 --> 28:43.780
valued for its depth and refinement.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.310
Back in those days,

28:45.640 --> 28:48.840
when your Sixth Grandfather,
Seventh Grandfather, and I

28:49.030 --> 28:50.000
were together.

28:51.510 --> 28:52.350
Well...

28:53.960 --> 28:54.830
What is it?

28:57.000 --> 28:58.860
We had such a great time together.

29:01.070 --> 29:01.830
Mother.

29:01.830 --> 29:02.550
Little Fish.

29:02.550 --> 29:03.110
Mother.

29:03.110 --> 29:03.680
Eat.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.960
Look who's here.

29:05.720 --> 29:06.640
Seventh Grandmother.

29:06.640 --> 29:07.350
Zhen.

29:08.030 --> 29:08.790
Zhen.

29:09.110 --> 29:10.720
Mother, I'll get back to work then.

29:10.720 --> 29:11.440
Go ahead.

29:15.440 --> 29:16.700
Seventh Grandmother.

29:19.070 --> 29:20.530
I haven't seen you in days—

29:21.240 --> 29:24.110
Zhen, you've lost some weight again.

29:25.140 --> 29:26.990
I'll have your eldest aunt

29:27.010 --> 29:28.350
make you something delicious

29:28.350 --> 29:30.080
and send it to the ink workshop.

29:30.350 --> 29:31.270
Thank you, Seventh Grandmother.

29:31.270 --> 29:32.200
Please sit down.

29:32.790 --> 29:34.790
Seventh Grandmother, you have no idea

29:34.790 --> 29:35.890
how much I've learned

29:35.890 --> 29:37.020
in the ink workshop.

29:37.830 --> 29:38.960
Zhen,

29:39.480 --> 29:41.080
you've been working so hard.

29:41.310 --> 29:44.370
What do you plan to do
once you've mastered everything?

29:46.480 --> 29:47.680
Well?

29:47.960 --> 29:49.640
Just say what's on your mind.

29:50.590 --> 29:53.640
You grew up by my side.

29:54.160 --> 29:56.030
How could I not know

29:56.200 --> 29:57.720
what you're planning?

29:58.270 --> 29:59.530
Seventh Grandmother.

29:59.640 --> 30:01.350
The fact I can study in the ink workshop

30:01.350 --> 30:03.750
is all thanks to you
and Sixth Grandfather.

30:03.880 --> 30:05.340
I will always remember it.

30:06.160 --> 30:07.490
But at the end of the day,

30:07.880 --> 30:10.550
I'm not a member of the Li family.

30:10.830 --> 30:12.890
If I stay in the ink workshop forever,

30:13.110 --> 30:15.000
Uncle Jingdong and Fourth Aunt

30:15.310 --> 30:16.910
will not stand for it either.

30:17.440 --> 30:18.920
So your plan is to learn

30:19.070 --> 30:22.070
as much as you can in the ink workshop,

30:23.070 --> 30:25.200
and once you've built up enough skill,

30:25.960 --> 30:27.790
you'll start your own business.

30:28.070 --> 30:29.030
Am I right?

30:31.880 --> 30:33.140
Seventh Grandmother,

30:33.640 --> 30:35.000
you already knew?

30:36.240 --> 30:37.880
I think about leaving every day.

30:37.880 --> 30:39.940
You won't be upset about it, will you?

30:40.000 --> 30:41.030
What do you think?

30:44.510 --> 30:45.480
Back then,

30:46.070 --> 30:48.790
you made an agreement with me.

30:49.070 --> 30:51.070
Now that the goal has been achieved,

30:51.590 --> 30:54.790
I certainly won't interfere
with your freedom.

30:55.880 --> 30:57.810
But I just want to ask you one thing.

30:58.270 --> 31:00.830
With what you've learned so far,

31:01.160 --> 31:02.480
is it enough for you

31:02.480 --> 31:05.210
to open an ink workshop
and run your own business?

31:05.550 --> 31:06.590
To be honest,

31:07.070 --> 31:08.920
right after I finished learning
from Grandfather,

31:08.920 --> 31:10.590
I had a hundred times more confidence.

31:10.590 --> 31:13.030
I thought as long as I knew
how to make ink,

31:13.110 --> 31:14.920
nothing else would be a problem.

31:15.590 --> 31:18.270
But after working inside the ink workshop,

31:18.400 --> 31:21.350
I've realized that every part
of this business has its own complexities.

31:21.350 --> 31:23.680
I still have so much to learn.

31:24.310 --> 31:26.370
Compared to you, Sixth Grandfather,

31:26.400 --> 31:28.830
Manager Shao, and Manager Sun,

31:29.070 --> 31:30.790
I am still too far behind.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.590
In that case,

31:33.030 --> 31:34.240
how about I

31:34.830 --> 31:37.880
propose another partnership to you?

31:41.030 --> 31:43.160
The ancient lacquer-soot ink is done.

31:43.160 --> 31:45.270
I've made a partnership

31:45.310 --> 31:47.400
with Master Qi and Master Fan.

31:49.830 --> 31:53.030
The ink workshop urgently needs
to increase production.

31:53.880 --> 31:55.080
I would like to ask you

31:55.350 --> 31:56.790
to stay and work with Li Ink

31:56.790 --> 31:58.270
for one more year.

31:58.920 --> 31:59.920
During this year,

32:00.030 --> 32:02.680
besides managing the ink workshop
and increasing production,

32:02.680 --> 32:05.400
you'll also need to develop a new ink—

32:06.040 --> 32:07.620
one that just
like the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

32:07.620 --> 32:09.880
Make a name for it
and open up new markets!

32:11.160 --> 32:12.490
If the new ink succeeds,

32:12.550 --> 32:13.680
I will give you

32:14.110 --> 32:17.160
a five-percent share of Li Ink's profits.

32:21.830 --> 32:24.790
The conditions might be a bit harsh,

32:25.000 --> 32:26.460
but you should understand

32:26.720 --> 32:28.520
that in the Huizhou's industry,

32:28.590 --> 32:31.830
you are still a newcomer.

32:32.270 --> 32:34.870
Don't think that
just because you have talent,

32:35.070 --> 32:37.550
others will think highly of you.

32:38.480 --> 32:39.720
That's great, Zhen.

32:40.110 --> 32:40.790
This way,

32:40.790 --> 32:42.510
you can continue learning in the workshop

32:42.510 --> 32:44.710
with Sixth Grandfather and the others.

32:46.000 --> 32:47.400
Seventh Grandmother...

32:48.030 --> 32:48.720
Go back

32:48.880 --> 32:50.790
and think it through carefully.

32:52.510 --> 32:54.430
Then come talk to me.

33:07.400 --> 33:10.480
Today, Seventh Grandmother
specifically came to see me.

33:10.480 --> 33:11.510
She said

33:13.400 --> 33:15.930
she wants me
to stay at Li Ink for another year.

33:17.510 --> 33:18.830
And what do you

33:19.550 --> 33:20.680
think about it?

33:21.790 --> 33:22.990
To be honest, Mother,

33:23.510 --> 33:26.240
what I've seen and learnd
at Li Ink these past few months

33:26.240 --> 33:27.880
has truly opened my eyes.

33:28.480 --> 33:30.270
Running an ink workshop well

33:30.270 --> 33:32.600
simply cannot be done by one person alone.

33:33.000 --> 33:34.920
It requires collective wisdom and effort,

33:34.920 --> 33:36.550
the best glue room,

33:36.720 --> 33:38.750
the best pounding craftsman,

33:38.960 --> 33:40.750
and precise management

33:40.750 --> 33:42.410
at every stage of production.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.640
Only then can we ensure

33:43.640 --> 33:45.900
the quality of every finished ink stick.

33:46.720 --> 33:48.510
From a long-term perspective,

33:49.640 --> 33:50.400
indeed,

33:51.440 --> 33:52.590
staying at Li Ink

33:52.830 --> 33:54.760
is the best learning opportunity.

33:55.690 --> 33:57.150
I have no reason to refuse.

34:01.350 --> 34:03.200
Even with so many advantages,

34:03.720 --> 34:06.550
you're still hesitating inside,

34:07.920 --> 34:08.880
aren't you?

34:16.440 --> 34:18.900
Whenever I think
of what happened back then,

34:19.320 --> 34:20.850
my heart still feels heavy.

34:23.550 --> 34:25.230
Staying at Li Ink...

34:26.440 --> 34:28.639
I really never thought about it before.

34:33.510 --> 34:35.550
I know what you are thinking.

34:36.550 --> 34:37.810
You still cannot let go

34:37.960 --> 34:40.670
of your resentment toward the Li family.

34:44.400 --> 34:45.960
Actually, neither can I.

34:48.630 --> 34:49.550
However,

34:50.070 --> 34:51.800
those are two separate things.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.110
You've spent three years
learning ink-making,

34:54.110 --> 34:56.670
and you finally got your career on track.

34:58.190 --> 34:59.190
I think

34:59.670 --> 35:01.630
you shouldn't give it up so easily

35:01.840 --> 35:03.170
because of old grudges.

35:05.250 --> 35:05.920
Mother.

35:06.190 --> 35:07.000
I know.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.630
Business is business,

35:08.760 --> 35:09.960
and grudges are grudges.

35:09.960 --> 35:11.690
They cannot be mixed together.

35:11.760 --> 35:13.440
But even if I understand that,

35:13.480 --> 35:14.670
the people of the Sixth Branch

35:14.670 --> 35:16.400
and the Seventh Branch may not.

35:16.880 --> 35:18.000
This time, I returned to the Li family

35:18.000 --> 35:19.460
only to help temporarily,

35:19.670 --> 35:21.230
without any interests involved,

35:21.230 --> 35:23.000
so they could tolerate it.

35:24.400 --> 35:27.110
But if I stay at Li Ink
as a manager and start taking

35:27.110 --> 35:28.370
a share of the profits,

35:28.590 --> 35:30.520
they'll definitely be resentful.

35:30.760 --> 35:31.820
When that happens,

35:31.880 --> 35:34.680
they'll find ways
to make things difficult for me.

35:38.630 --> 35:40.690
I just want to learn ink-making well.

35:41.230 --> 35:43.230
I don't want to deal with all of that.

35:43.880 --> 35:45.670
And most of all,
I don't want to put Seventh Grandmother

35:45.670 --> 35:47.930
and Eldest Aunt in a difficult position.

35:51.670 --> 35:53.070
My good daughter

35:53.550 --> 35:54.920
really has grown up.

35:56.840 --> 35:58.960
You've thought this through

35:58.960 --> 36:01.190
far more clearly than I expected.

36:03.150 --> 36:04.070
Now that

36:04.110 --> 36:06.230
the pros and cons are obvious,

36:06.960 --> 36:09.000
neither choice is wrong.

36:09.760 --> 36:11.420
I will support you either way.

36:14.320 --> 36:15.110
Zhen,

36:15.480 --> 36:16.230
remember.

36:17.070 --> 36:19.200
if you choose to leave Li Ink Workshop,

36:19.840 --> 36:22.370
I'll have a hot meal ready
and waiting for you.

36:24.070 --> 36:25.480
If you choose to stay,

36:26.550 --> 36:27.320
remember,

36:27.590 --> 36:30.030
I'm not such a narrow-minded person.

36:30.280 --> 36:32.030
Just go and do what you want.

36:32.470 --> 36:34.670
Don't worry about me being upset.

36:42.670 --> 36:43.480
Mother.

36:46.480 --> 36:47.280
I'm hungry.

36:48.960 --> 36:50.880
I left something delicious
for you in the pot.

36:50.880 --> 36:52.540
I completely forgot about it.

37:01.750 --> 37:08.700
[Zhengxin Hall]

37:01.920 --> 37:03.840
Aunt Rujun, that's unreasonable.

37:03.840 --> 37:06.800
Working with that girl
to recreate the ancient lacquer-soot ink

37:06.800 --> 37:08.590
was only a temporary measure.

37:09.110 --> 37:11.670
Now that the ink is made,

37:11.960 --> 37:14.490
why should we let her stay
in the ink workshop?

37:15.230 --> 37:17.480
Zhen saved Li Ink in its hour of need.

37:18.070 --> 37:19.630
No matter what happened in the past,

37:19.630 --> 37:21.230
we should be grateful to her.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.290
Sister-in-law.

37:23.360 --> 37:24.800
Hearing you say that,

37:25.110 --> 37:27.240
I think that girl is really something.

37:29.300 --> 37:30.630
But then again,

37:30.760 --> 37:32.230
she did help us,

37:32.320 --> 37:34.110
we didn't mistreat her either.

37:34.760 --> 37:37.360
Not only did she get the hundred taels
of reward from Master Qi,

37:37.360 --> 37:39.320
she also used the foundation of Li Ink

37:39.320 --> 37:41.440
to gain fame and wealth for herself.

37:42.110 --> 37:43.570
If she stays another year,

37:44.190 --> 37:45.670
won't the entire Li Ink business

37:45.670 --> 37:47.590
fall under her control?

37:48.550 --> 37:49.510
Enough.

37:51.720 --> 37:52.770
You all know

37:52.790 --> 37:54.260
that girl now

37:55.030 --> 37:56.300
has both fame

37:56.330 --> 37:57.940
and skills.

37:58.630 --> 38:00.070
If you don't want her,

38:00.880 --> 38:02.670
every ink workshop in Huizhou

38:04.000 --> 38:05.670
will beg for her to join them.

38:06.190 --> 38:06.960
Father,

38:08.030 --> 38:10.590
why are you speaking up for that girl too?

38:11.150 --> 38:13.190
Have you forgotten how Li Ink declined?

38:13.190 --> 38:14.280
Have you forgotten how my leg

38:14.280 --> 38:15.670
was broken?

38:15.670 --> 38:16.550
Your leg!

38:17.550 --> 38:18.840
It's been 13 years,

38:20.070 --> 38:22.270
and all you ever think about is your leg!

38:23.400 --> 38:25.430
Just because you can't stand anymore,

38:25.430 --> 38:27.020
does that mean
the entire Li family has to

38:27.020 --> 38:28.980
kneel alongside you?

38:31.550 --> 38:32.550
Jinhe,

38:34.800 --> 38:37.510
you can't blame it all on Jingdong.

38:39.000 --> 38:40.190
Over the years,

38:41.150 --> 38:42.190
indeed,

38:43.150 --> 38:44.880
I did favor Zhen

38:45.360 --> 38:47.020
and intentionally train her.

38:47.710 --> 38:50.880
At times, I may have gone too far,

38:53.190 --> 38:55.590
and inevitably hurt Jingdong's feelings.

38:58.150 --> 38:59.590
But Jingdong,

39:00.840 --> 39:02.900
you are a descendant of the Li family.

39:03.320 --> 39:05.320
You must think for Li Ink.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.540
The reason I asked Zhen

39:08.590 --> 39:10.360
to continue helping at Li Ink

39:11.400 --> 39:13.800
is for the revival of Li Ink itself.

39:14.590 --> 39:16.050
What I fear is that one day,

39:16.070 --> 39:17.670
the ink workshop will fall
into the Eighth Branch's hands,

39:17.670 --> 39:19.550
and by then,
it will be too late for regrets.

39:19.550 --> 39:20.880
Jiangyue.

39:21.840 --> 39:22.920
Mother.

39:23.000 --> 39:23.860
That's enough.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.300
With Aunt Rujun guaranteeing it,

39:27.510 --> 39:29.570
what's there left to complain about?

39:58.400 --> 39:59.730
Fourth Young Mistress.

40:00.150 --> 40:01.230
Baiyi.

40:01.400 --> 40:03.360
Did something happen to my cousin?

40:04.630 --> 40:06.630
Something is about to happen to her.

40:07.670 --> 40:09.070
I was worried about her,

40:09.110 --> 40:10.630
so I asked Hong to find you

40:10.670 --> 40:12.600
because I needed to speak with you.

40:14.840 --> 40:16.230
Mother wants Li Zhen

40:16.480 --> 40:18.070
to renew her contract for another year.

40:18.070 --> 40:19.630
Another year?

40:22.840 --> 40:24.760
That girl is quite something.

40:25.280 --> 40:28.340
She really got the Old Madam
wrapped around her finger.

40:33.190 --> 40:34.360
Baiyi,

40:34.550 --> 40:37.590
I can tell you've been so focused
on work at the ink workshop

40:37.590 --> 40:41.320
that you haven't been paying attention
to what's happening behind the scenes.

40:41.320 --> 40:43.850
Please enlighten me, Fourth Young Mistress.

40:43.920 --> 40:46.850
This one-year contract
is more than just a contract.

40:47.710 --> 40:49.360
She gave Li Zhen a key

40:49.510 --> 40:51.760
to enter the Li family.

40:53.230 --> 40:54.490
That's unacceptable!

40:56.800 --> 40:58.070
Fourth Young Mistress,

40:58.070 --> 40:59.920
Zhen opposes me at every turn.

41:00.150 --> 41:01.630
Not only did she demote me
to a junior worker,

41:01.630 --> 41:03.440
she even has Father
watching me constantly.

41:03.440 --> 41:04.480
If she is slightly dissatisfied,

41:04.480 --> 41:06.210
she'll have my father scold me.

41:06.280 --> 41:07.550
Ever since she came to the ink workshop,

41:07.550 --> 41:10.150
she's thrown everything into chaos.

41:11.320 --> 41:12.880
If she refuses to leave,

41:13.320 --> 41:14.850
how are we supposed to live?

41:15.030 --> 41:18.090
She recreated
the ancient lacquer-soot ink after all.

41:19.320 --> 41:21.720
Mother is completely bewitched by her now.

41:22.320 --> 41:23.880
She won't listen to us.

41:26.030 --> 41:27.070
From now on,

41:27.440 --> 41:28.510
the "Li" in Li Ink

41:29.510 --> 41:31.360
may no longer be our Li.

41:31.920 --> 41:33.230
I'd like to see her try!

41:37.400 --> 41:39.920
Zhengyou is the legitimate heir
of the Li family.

41:39.920 --> 41:41.400
One day, the Li family properties

41:41.400 --> 41:43.150
will be inherited to him.

41:45.070 --> 41:47.400
The Sixth Branch won't plan for Zhengyou,

41:47.510 --> 41:49.360
and your cousin is too soft-hearted,

41:49.360 --> 41:52.090
always listening to Old Madam
about everything.

41:54.840 --> 41:56.760
You are Zhengyou's uncle.

41:57.840 --> 41:59.840
People always say
a maternal uncle is closest to the child.

41:59.840 --> 42:00.920
At a time like this,

42:01.230 --> 42:03.190
he has to rely on you.

42:18.840 --> 42:19.670
Old Madam.

42:20.000 --> 42:21.130
Early this morning,

42:21.320 --> 42:23.320
hand-copied recipes for lacquer-soot ink

42:23.320 --> 42:25.760
were found outside
every ink workshop on Sibao Street.

42:25.760 --> 42:26.630
At first,

42:26.630 --> 42:28.630
we thought it was just a prank.

42:29.000 --> 42:31.230
But thanks to our manager being cautious,

42:31.230 --> 42:32.190
we confirmed

42:32.190 --> 42:34.760
that it is our ink recipe
for lacquer-soot ink.

42:34.760 --> 42:36.150
The ink recipe

42:36.710 --> 42:39.440
is the closely guarded secret
of every workshop.

42:40.110 --> 42:41.400
Once it leaks out,

42:42.030 --> 42:43.230
other workshops

42:44.280 --> 42:45.960
can easily copy it.

42:46.280 --> 42:47.880
No matter how good the ink is,

42:48.440 --> 42:49.960
it will be impossible
to sell it at a high price.

42:49.960 --> 42:50.880
Old Madam.

42:51.230 --> 42:52.320
The leak of the secret formula

42:52.320 --> 42:54.320
affects not only Li Ink's business,

42:54.510 --> 42:56.590
but also our reputation.

42:56.710 --> 42:57.840
Seventh Grandmother.
